{"3355410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DADCORE", "steam_appid": 3355410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DADCORE is a chaotic 4-player co-op dad simulator where being a dad is survival horror. </strong>Fight off Taxes, Mortgage, Inflation, and other nightmares of adult life while completing chores to keep the family budget alive. Every bullet costs money, so fix stuff, dig up junk in the backyard, sell your finds, and deal with everyday dad problems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-op</strong> — survive adulthood together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chores Pay the Bills</strong> — mow the lawn, fix the sink, take out the trash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Family Budget</strong> — every purchase hurts everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Bullet Costs Money</strong> — miss your shots, lose your savings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dad’s Pride</strong> — do dad things to charge powerful abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Adult Life</strong> — Taxes, Mortgage, Inflation, Bills, Fines and more.<br><br><strong>Dad times call for dad measures.</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DADCORE is a chaotic 4-player co-op dad simulator where being a dad is survival horror. </strong>Fight off Taxes, Mortgage, Inflation, and other nightmares of adult life while completing chores to keep the family budget alive. Every bullet costs money, so fix stuff, dig up junk in the backyard, sell your finds, and deal with everyday dad problems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-op</strong> — survive adulthood together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chores Pay the Bills</strong> — m